<title>JAPAN: Sony Music - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Sony Music - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 93.13		vs	   89.50</p>
<p> Operating	    3.45		vs	    7.15</p>
<p> Current		4.46		vs	    8.81</p>
